{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Far, far away from warm beaches, Polly the polar land rests at the cold ends of Earth.","words":[[0,0.49],[0.57,0.91],[0.97,1.25],[1.31,1.51],[1.61,1.97],[2.06,2.79],[3,3.33],[3.4,3.47],[3.55,3.99],[4.06,4.37],[4.46,4.78],[4.84,4.95],[4.99,5.06],[5.13,5.51],[5.6,5.84],[5.9,5.99],[6.13,6.78]]},{"text":"Earth has two polar regions. One is in the north, and one is in the south.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.46,0.67],[0.77,1],[1.09,1.49],[1.56,2.25],[2.58,2.79],[2.83,2.94],[3.01,3.1],[3.16,3.23],[3.31,3.79],[3.83,4.03],[4.12,4.31],[4.35,4.46],[4.53,4.6],[4.66,4.72],[4.81,5.67]]},{"text":"The sun feels weak here. Polar lands stay very cold most of the year.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.26,0.51],[0.59,0.91],[1,1.26],[1.35,1.79],[2.17,2.62],[2.71,3.1],[3.15,3.45],[3.53,3.8],[3.9,4.33],[4.41,4.68],[4.74,4.81],[4.87,4.93],[5,5.71]]},{"text":"Snow and ice cover the ground. Some places stay frozen for many years.","words":[[0,0.48],[0.56,0.7],[0.79,1.1],[1.16,1.52],[1.59,1.66],[1.72,2.29],[2.67,2.94],[2.98,3.45],[3.5,3.79],[3.88,4.39],[4.47,4.64],[4.72,4.99],[5.06,5.9]]},{"text":"Animals wear warm coats of fur or feathers. Blubber and thick skin help too.","words":[[0,0.53],[0.6,0.84],[0.92,1.21],[1.3,1.63],[1.68,1.78],[1.86,2.17],[2.28,2.42],[2.51,3.15],[3.47,3.91],[3.99,4.14],[4.24,4.53],[4.59,4.96],[5.05,5.33],[5.41,6.08]]},{"text":"Polar bears roam the north. Penguins live in the south, not together.","words":[[0,0.42],[0.49,0.87],[0.95,1.22],[1.29,1.36],[1.44,2.02],[2.35,2.9],[2.98,3.2],[3.23,3.3],[3.34,3.41],[3.5,3.98],[4.04,4.27],[4.32,5.29]]},{"text":"In summer, the sun can stay up for a long time. In winter, darkness lasts for weeks.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.28,0.8],[0.87,1.02],[1.08,1.28],[1.35,1.51],[1.57,1.85],[1.92,2.03],[2.11,2.3],[2.37,2.39],[2.47,2.73],[2.81,3.27],[3.66,3.81],[3.9,4.38],[4.43,4.96],[5.02,5.32],[5.38,5.56],[5.67,6.46]]},{"text":"Few people live here, but scientists visit to study ice, animals, and weather.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.37,0.74],[0.81,1.04],[1.1,1.45],[1.63,1.83],[1.9,2.54],[2.61,2.96],[3.02,3.11],[3.17,3.53],[3.62,4.08],[4.28,4.9],[4.95,5.11],[5.19,5.94]]},{"text":"Polly reminds us: life can survive even in very cold places.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.48,0.94],[1,1.28],[1.66,1.94],[1.99,2.16],[2.23,2.75],[2.81,3.08],[3.13,3.23],[3.37,3.7],[3.79,4.11],[4.18,5.16]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: the poles are icy, cold, and full of amazing adaptations.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.81],[0.84,0.96],[1.04,1.7],[1.9,2.04],[2.11,2.46],[2.52,2.68],[2.76,3.26],[3.32,3.76],[3.79,3.94],[4.03,4.27],[4.34,4.41],[4.49,5.02],[5.08,6.41]]}]}